  "about": {
    "title": "About Negus Gebeya",
    "paragraph1": "Negus Gebeya is Ethiopia's premier online marketplace, connecting buyers and sellers across the country with trust and transparency. We believe in empowering local communities by providing a platform where authentic Ethiopian products — from coffee and spices to handcrafted goods — can be discovered and traded with confidence.",
    "paragraph2": "Our mission is to foster economic growth by supporting small businesses, artisans, and farmers. We prioritize fair pricing, secure payments, and verified profiles to ensure a safe and reliable experience for everyone. Every transaction on Negus Gebeya helps sustain local livelihoods and celebrates Ethiopia's rich cultural heritage.",
    "paragraph3": "We are a team of passionate Ethiopians dedicated to building a marketplace that works for all. Whether you're a buyer looking for unique treasures or a seller wanting to reach a wider audience, Negus Gebeya is your trusted partner.",
    "cta": "Join our community today and be part of Ethiopia's growing digital economy."
  },
